iah 42:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.2\">Is 42:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.4\">58:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשׁ׳ קוֹל תְּהִלָּתוֹ</span> †<a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:8\" href=\"/Psalms.66.8\">ψ 66:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּקוֹל תּוֹדָה</span> †<a data-ref=\"Psalms 26:7\" href=\"/Psalms.26.7\">26:7</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"abs. as musical term, <em>sound aloud</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּמְצִלְתַּיִם לְהַשְׁמִיעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.19\">1 Ch 15:19</a> (perhaps to mark the time, Gr <a data-ref=\"Psalms 67\" href=\"/Psalms.67\">ψ 67</a> De: cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 16:5\" href=\"/Psalms.16.5\">16:5</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 150:5\" href=\"/Psalms.150.5\">ψ 150:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּצִלְצְלֵי שָׁ֑מַע</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׁמִיעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.16\">15:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.42\">16:42</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַשׁ׳ קוֹל אֶחָד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.13\">2 Ch 5:13</a> i.e. prob. in unison (Prince<sup>EB iii. 3241</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.42\">Ne 12:42</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"abs. <em>make proclamation</em> (often ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הִגִּיד</span>), <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:9\" href=\"/Amos.3.9\">Am 3:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:5\" href=\"/Amos.4.5\">4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.26\">Is 41:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.5\">Je 4:5</a> + 6 times Je."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׁמִיעוּ</span>, acc. pers. + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> loc. = <em>summon</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.29\">Je 50:29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> loc. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.27\">51:27</a> (cf.